Package: sediros-guest
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: The SedirOS Authors <ahmetatakan.tech@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd (>= 254), passwd, init-system-helpers, ufw
Description: SedirOS VM guest integration
 For VM images started by the sediros CLI. The image contains no SSH key:
 sediros launch passes the user's public key as the systemd credential
 sediros.ssh.authorized_keys, and this package adds it to the admin user's
 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys at boot. Does nothing without that credential.
 .
 Also exempts the VM host (10.0.2.2, QEMU user networking) from UFW's
 SSH rate limit, which the launcher's readiness probes would otherwise trip.
